#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:137
#, xml-text
msgid "Installation of GTK 4"
msgstr "Instalação do GTK 4"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:149
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"Install <application>GTK 4</application> by running the following commands:"
msgstr ""
"Instale o &quot;<application>GTK 4</application>&quot; executando os "
"seguintes comandos:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:153
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"            -D broadway-backend=true \\\n"
"            -D introspection=enabled \\\n"
"            -D vulkan=enabled        \\\n"
"            .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>mkdir build &amp;&amp;\n"
"cd    build &amp;&amp;\n"
"\n"
"meson setup --prefix=/usr            \\\n"
"            --buildtype=release      \\\n"
"            -D broadway-backend=true \\\n"
"            -D introspection=enabled \\\n"
"            -D vulkan=enabled        \\\n"
"            .. &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:165
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you have <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> installed and wish to build the API "
"documentation for this package, issue:"
msgstr ""
"Se você tiver <xref linkend='gi-docgen'/> instalado e desejar construir a "
"documentação da API para esse pacote, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:169
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>sed \"s@'doc'@&amp; / 'gtk-&gtk4-version;'@\" -i ../docs/reference/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D documentation=true                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>sed \"s@'doc'@&amp; / 'gtk-&gtk4-version;'@\" -i ../docs/reference/meson.build &amp;&amp;\n"
"meson configure -D documentation=true                            &amp;&amp;\n"
"ninja</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:174
#, xml-text
msgid "To run the tests, issue:"
msgstr "Para executar os testes, emita:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:177
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid ""
"<userinput>env -u{GALLIUM_DRIVER,MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE}          \\\n"
"    LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1 VK_LOADER_DRIVERS_SELECT='lvp*' \\\n"
"    dbus-run-session meson test --setup x11                 \\\n"
"                                --no-suite={headless,needs-udmabuf}</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<userinput>env -u{GALLIUM_DRIVER,MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE}          \\\n"
"    LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1 VK_LOADER_DRIVERS_SELECT='lvp*' \\\n"
"    dbus-run-session meson test --setup x11                 \\\n"
"                                --no-suite={headless,needs-udmabuf}</userinput>"

#.       On some systems as many as 212 tests may fail (out of over 6100) for
#.       unknown reasons.
#.       I hope this is gone with LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE and -\-no-suite
#. dmabuf.
#.       If not please restore them.  - xry111
#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:183
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"If you are in a Wayland session, replace the one occurrence of "
"<literal>x11</literal> with <literal>wayland</literal>.  Many tests will "
"fail if <filename>~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename> exists and the "
"gtk-modules line is not commented out.  Several other tests may fail for "
"unknown reason.  On systems with NVIDIA graphics cards, the tests may take "
"significantly longer."
msgstr ""
"Se você estiver em uma sessão do Wayland, substitua a ocorrência de "
"<literal>x11</literal> por <literal>wayland</literal>. Muitos testes "
"falharão se <filename>~/.config/gtk-4.0/settings.ini</filename> existir e a "
"linha gtk-modules não estiver comentada. Vários outros testes possivelmente "
"falhem por motivo desconhecido. Em sistemas com placas de vídeo NVIDIA, os "
"testes possivelmente levem significativamente mais tempo."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:229
#, xml-text
msgid "Now, as the <systemitem class=\"username\">root</systemitem> user:"
msgstr ""
"Agora, como o(a) usuário(a) &quot;<systemitem "
"class=\"username\">root</systemitem>&quot;:"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><screen>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:232
#, no-wrap, xml-text
msgid "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"
msgstr "<userinput>ninja install</userinput>"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><title>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:236
#, xml-text
msgid "Command Explanations"
msgstr "Explicações do Comando"

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:242
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D broadway-backend=true</parameter>: This switch enables the "
"HTML5 GDK backend."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D broadway-backend=true</parameter>: Essa chave habilita a "
"estrutura HTML5 de retaguarda do GDK."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:247
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>-D introspection=enabled</parameter>: This switch enables using "
"GObject Introspection to generate GIR bindings of this packages.  These "
"bindings are required by GNOME."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>-D introspection=enabled</parameter>: Essa chave habilita usar "
"GObject Introspection para gerar ligações GIR desses pacotes. Essas ligações"
" são exigidas pelo GNOME."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:253
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D cloudproviders=enabled</option>: Use this switch if you have "
"<xref linkend=\"libcloudproviders\" role=\"nodep\"/> installed and wish to "
"enable support for cloud providers in a file chooser window."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D cloudproviders=enabled</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o "
"<xref linkend=\"libcloudproviders\" role=\"nodep\"/> instalado e desejar "
"habilitar o suporte para provedores de nuvem em uma janela de seleção de "
"arquivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:259
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D tracker=enabled</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"tinysparql\"/> installed and wish to use search functionality when"
" running a file chooser."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D tracker=enabled</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o <xref "
"linkend=\"tinysparql\"/> instalado e desejar usar a funcionalidade de "
"pesquisa ao executar um seletor de arquivos."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:265
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D colord=enabled</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend=\"colord\"/> installed and wish to use colord with the CUPS printing"
" backend."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D colord=enabled</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o <xref "
"linkend=\"colord\"/> instalado e desejar usar o colord com a estrutura de "
"retaguarda de impressão do CUPS."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:271
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D man-pages=true</option>: Use this switch if you have <xref "
"linkend='docutils'/> installed and wish to generate the man pages."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D man-pages=true</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o <xref "
"linkend='docutils'/> instalado e desejar gerar as páginas de manual."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:277
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D sysprof=enabled</option>: Use this switch if you have <ulink "
"url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink> installed and wish to enable tracing "
"support for GTK4-based applications."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D sysprof=enabled</option>: Use essa chave se você tiver o <ulink "
"url=\"&sysprof-url;\">sysprof</ulink> instalado e desejar habilitar o "
"suporte de rastreamento para aplicativos baseados em GTK4."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:283
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<option>-D vulkan=disabled</option>: Use this switch instead of "
"<parameter>-D vulkan=enabled</parameter> if you don't have <xref "
"linkend=\"vulkan-loader\"/> or <xref linkend=\"glslc\"/> installed.  It will"
" disable the Vulkan backend that the upstream prefers to use on Wayland-"
"based graphical environments."
msgstr ""
"<option>-D vulkan=disabled</option>: Use essa chave em vez de <parameter>-D "
"vulkan=enabled</parameter> se você não tiver <xref linkend=\"vulkan-"
"loader\"/> ou <xref linkend=\"glslc\"/> instalado. Ela desabilitará a "
"estrutura de retaguarda do Vulkan que o fluxo de desenvolvimento prefere "
"usar em ambientes gráficos baseados em Wayland."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:291
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<envar>LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1</envar> and "
"<envar>VK_LOADER_DRIVERS_SELECT='lvp*'</envar>: Force the test suite to use "
"the softpipe or llvmpipe Gallium driver and the lavapipe Vulkan driver from "
"Mesa.  The test suite is so sensitive that the minor differences caused by a"
" different Mesa driver can trigger test failures."
msgstr ""
"<envar>LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1</envar> e "
"<envar>VK_LOADER_DRIVERS_SELECT='lvp*'</envar>: Força a suíte de teste a "
"usar o controlador Gallium softpipe ou llvmpipe e o controlador Vulkan "
"lavapipe originário do Mesa. A suíte de teste é tão sensível que as pequenas"
" diferenças causadas por um controlador Mesa diferente podem deflagrar "
"falhas de teste."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:300
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<command>env -u{GALLIUM_DRIVER,MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE}</command>: Unset"
" variables which may conflict with <envar>LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1</envar>."
msgstr ""
"<command>env -u{GALLIUM_DRIVER,MESA_LOADER_DRIVER_OVERRIDE}</command>: "
"Desconfigura variáveis que possam conflitar com "
"<envar>LIBGL_ALWAYS_SOFTWARE=1</envar>."

#. type: Content of: <sect1><sect2><para>
#: blfs-en/x/lib/gtk4.xml:306
#, xml-text
msgid ""
"<parameter>--no-suite={headless,needs-udmabuf}</parameter>: Disable the "
"tests requiring the external dependency pydbus, and the tests requiring the "
"device node <filename class='devicefile'>/dev/udmabuf</filename>.  The "
"device node does not exist if the feature is not enabled in the kernel "
"configuration<phrase revision='sysv'>, and even if it exists it cannot be "
"accessed as unprivileged users</phrase>."
msgstr ""
"<parameter>--no-suite={headless,needs-udmabuf}</parameter>: Desabilita os "
"testes que exigem a dependência externa pydbus e os testes que exigem o nó "
"do dispositivo <filename class='devicefile'>/dev/udmabuf</filename>. O nó do"
" dispositivo não existe se o recurso não estiver habilitado na configuração "
"do núcleo<phrase revision='sysv'>e, mesmo que exista, não pode ser acessado "
"como usuários(as) sem privilégios</phrase>."

